<title>GREECE: HELLENIC TOURISM TENDERS GOLF COURSE IN SALONICA.</title>
<headline>HELLENIC TOURISM TENDERS GOLF COURSE IN SALONICA.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hellenic Tourism Organisation (EOT) announced an international public bidding competition with sealed bids for the construction and long-term use of a 18-hole golf course in Epanomi, Salonica.</p>
<p>In an ad in the Financial Times, EOT said the bidding will be carried out at the offices of the directorate of exploitation at Voulis 7 on Monday September 9  before a bidding committee set up for this purpose.</p>
<p>Interested parties may obtain the invitation text from EOT offices. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
